  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling the Implementation of Regenerative Forest Business</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program aims to facilitate the transformation process in forest management from timber-based to multi-product-based forest management, as mandated in the recently issued Government of Indonesia regulation on multi-use forestry management. With the new regulation, forestry companies are urged to increase land value through the development of mixed forests and explore high economic value activities, such as non-timber forest products, agroforestry, payments for ecosystem services, and others.</narrative>
  </description>
